# component-architecture

The component system follows a base media card pattern with specialized extensions:

### Card Component Hierarchy

`src/components/card-media.astro`
- Base media card wrapper providing shared display logic 
- Accepts generic media content through slots
- Standardizes media presentation across the system

`src/components/card-youtube.astro`
- Extends base media card for YouTube content
- Implements specialized video embedding
- Translates YouTube URLs into embedded players

### Content Integration 

The media components integrate with content collections to enable:
- Dynamic media insertion in content blocks
- Consistent media rendering across collection types
- Automated YouTube URL processing

Importance Score: 45
